# Research Phase Constraints

- Scope all research to the Phase 0a problem statement.
- Decompose broad queries into targeted searches.
- Flag unknowns as spike candidates with `⚠️`.
- Do NOT proceed to planning if `⚠️` markers exist in Open Questions.
- Each search targets ONE specific research question.
